<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BARCELONA 1 FIORENTINA 1 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA 1 FIORENTINA 1 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona of Spain and Fiorentina of Italy drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in the first leg of their European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Barcelona - Miguel Angel Nadal 42</p>
<p>Fiorentina - Gabriel Batistuta 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 110,000.</p>
</text>
